		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Kinco HMI Green GH (Enhanced) GH043E, 4.3 inch 480 x 272 operator panel. The terminals are the power plug, the DB9 pins of the COM ports (pin number and signal), Ethernet and the USB ports; the pinout comes from the GL070E manual, check it against the datasheet of your model.</elementInformation>
